<title>HONG KONG: Tsingtao Brewery 1996 net down 73.7 pct.</title>
<headline>Tsingtao Brewery 1996 net down 73.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million yuan unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (yuan)		    0.029	vs  0.109</p>
<p>    Dividend (yuan)	     nil	  vs  0.08</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	   28.38 loss vs  nil</p>
<p>    Net			     25.68	vs  97.79</p>
<p>    Turnover			1,431.91   vs  1,383.72</p>
<p>    Company name		  Tsingtao Brewery Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		   N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	    N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Tsingtao Brewery produces and sells beer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on disposal of staff quarters and writeoff of obsolete inventories.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs 0.08 yuan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
